# CLAUDE.local.md (personal, not committed)

Copy this to `CLAUDE.local.md` for personal, machine-specific notes that shouldn't be shared with everyone who clones the repo. `CLAUDE.local.md` is gitignored.

Use it for things like:

- The absolute path to your copy of the project on your machine.
- Personal reminders about your own bank exports (which account maps to which CSV format).
- Any local tweaks to how you run the app.

Nothing here overrides the shared rules in [`CLAUDE.md`](CLAUDE.md) — it just adds personal context for your own sessions.
